5	//! # Resilience
6	//!
7	//! Retry configuration, delay calculation, RFC 9110 `Retry-After` parsing,
8	//! retryable HTTP statuses, a [`RetryBudget`], and idempotency primitives:
9	//! FNV-1a [`IdempotencyKey`]s and already-done detection ([`already_done`]).
